**2. Then in your terminal, push the change:**
```
git add package.json
git commit -m "Move all deps to dependencies"
git push
```

Render will auto-deploy and this time it should install all 8 packages including vite. Also go back to Render **Settings** and set the Build Command back to just:
```
npm install && npm run build